WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:08.675
Witch:
By the pricking of my thumbs,
something wicked this way comes.

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:09.843
(Knock)

00:00:10.761 --> 00:00:12.346
(Castle bell rings)

00:00:12.346 --> 00:00:13.180
(Knock)

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:15.307
(Footsteps)

00:00:15.307 --> 00:00:18.685
My husband, king that shall be.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:22.648
(Footsteps)

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:23.607
Lord Macbeth:
If we should fail?

00:00:23.607 --> 00:00:24.107
(Knife unsheathing)

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:25.984
Lady Macbeth:
We fail.

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:31.073
Ahh!

00:00:31.073 --> 00:00:33.534
♪♪

00:00:35.244 --> 00:00:36.411
Lady Macbeth:
Didst thou not hear noise?

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:40.123
♪♪

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:42.334
Methought I heard a voice cry,
"Sleep no more."

00:00:42.334 --> 00:00:45.921
♪♪

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:46.463
Macduff:
Horror!

00:00:46.463 --> 00:00:52.886
♪♪

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:53.679
(Clang)

00:00:53.971 --> 00:00:54.763
Are you a man?

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:59.643
Lord Macbeth:
Ay, and a bold one, that dare
look upon that which might appall the devil!

00:00:59.643 --> 00:01:04.231
♪♪

00:01:04.231 --> 00:01:04.856
(Crows cawing)

00:01:04.856 --> 00:01:11.363
♪♪

00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:13.365
I have no words, my voice is in
my sword.

00:01:13.365 --> 00:01:13.907
(Clang)

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:18.453
♪♪

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:20.998
(Knock)

00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:24.001
(Knock)

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:27.296
(Knock)

